 power\u2014will secure the American homeland and onshore our critical supply chains. \n\nFORTRESS America will make life safer and better for all Americans.", "last_comment_created": 1791683494444, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 76, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": {"image": "https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2108656759866843136/oTqenWW6?format=jpg&name=800x419", "domain": "www.wsj.com", "description": "Nuclear reactors at bases would mean less pollution and reduced electricity rates for civilians.", "title": "Opinion | Hegseth Empowers America", "url": "https://t.co/oLk9FuzC6Z"}, "replies": 57, "created": 1791642992000, "id": "2108929678853468658", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2069918000778563584/zUjhjZ_g_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Sean Parnell", "username": "SeanParnellASW"}, "content": "Secretary Hegseth\u2019s FORTRESS America\u2014mandating that every major military installation in the U.S. generate its own power\u2014will secure the American homeland and onshore our critical supply chains. \n\nFORTRESS America will make life safer and better for all Americans.", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 1743}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVerpB0F", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 118, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8880143, "raw_content": "Besides hosting one at your home, there are tons of venues that you can either use for free or rent, including:\n\nSports Bars\n\nCigar Lounges\n\nBreweries and Taprooms\n\nDrive-in Theaters\n\nBowling Alleys\n\nArcades and Entertainment Complexes\n\nCommunity Centers\n\nApartment & HOA Clubhouses\n\nIf it's at night, you can even get a portable projector and screen and do it in your backyard, in a parking lot. or at a park.\n\nIf you are attempting to rent someplace out that's not based AF, I would suggest being vague about what the watch party is for. Get a contract. Make sure they can't cancel it once they find out.", "author": "DemPanicAtTheDisco", "created": 1791667971714, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "t-bone", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Wanna trigger the leftists? Execution watch parties.", "last_comment_created": 1791681882388, "content": "<p>Besides hosting one at your home, there are tons of venues that you can either use for free or rent, including:</p>\n<p>Sports Bars</p>\n<p>Cigar Lounges</p>\n<p>Breweries and Taprooms</p>\n<p>Drive-in Theaters</p>\n<p>Bowling Alleys</p>\n<p>Arcades and Entertainment Complexes</p>\n<p>Community Centers</p>\n<p>Apartment &amp; HOA Clubhouses</p>\n<p>If it's at night, you can even get a portable projector and screen and do it in your backyard, in a parking lot. or at a park.</p>\n<p>If you are attempting to rent someplace out that's not based AF, I would suggest being vague about what the watch party is for. Get a contract. Make sure they can't cancel it once they find out.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 15, "score_up": 118, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_m